~ start
match PlayerStats.scene_progress
	when 1
		if not PlayerStats.has_placed_puto
			Max: I'll put the puto bumbong on the dining table for the world to see.
			Max: What better way to enter your home with a surprise puto bumbong.
			do show_sprite("puto")
			$> PlayerStats.has_placed_puto = true
		else
			Max: I'm practically drooling just looking at 'em.
	when 4
		if not PlayerStats.has_placed_puto
			Max: ...Will no one come home to see the food splayed on our table?
			do show_sprite("puto")
			$> PlayerStats.has_placed_puto = true
		else
			Max: ...
=> END